flowchart TB
    subgraph LAB[Persistent lab boundary]
        AI[AI4R planner and research loop]
        FACT[CC factory]
        QUAL[Independent qualification and activation]
        PKG[Versioned robotics CC package]
        CTRL[Lab resource controller]
        OPS[Scoped operation invocations]
        SIM[Simulator service]
        STATE[Lab metadata and service state]
        ART[Versioned assets and sealed results]
        AI -->|select operation| OPS
        FACT -->|candidate| QUAL
        QUAL -->|eligible version| PKG
        PKG -->|operation contracts| OPS
        PKG -->|resource requirements| CTRL
        CTRL -->|start inspect stop and recover| SIM
        OPS -->|bounded commands and session handles| SIM
        SIM --> STATE
        SIM --> ART
        OPS -->|validated output import| ART
        AI -->|accepted findings| STATE
    end
